# Everything, then the few things the build actually needs back.
#
# An allowlist rather than a list of exclusions, because the cost of getting that wrong is invisible: a
# stray build directory or a database file in the context bloats every `docker build` and nothing says
# so. Getting *this* wrong fails the build loudly with a missing file.
*

!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd
!cmd/**
!internal
!internal/**

# And not these, wherever they turn up inside the directories above.
**/.DS_Store
**/*_test.go
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-wal
**/*.sqlite-shm
